.temp 27
.option reltol=1e-4 vntol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 method=trap klu seed=1 noopiter

Vdd vdd 0 1.2
Vdda vdda 0 3.3
Vbgi vbgw 0 DC 1.045 TRNOISE(0.0004646 4.73e-08 0 0)
Vbgf vbgi vbgw DC 0 TRNOISE(0 4.73e-08 1.15 1.285e-05)
Rbg vbgi vbg 190k
Ibref vdda nbr 5u
Vcm vcm 0 0.6
Vda vda 0 PWL(0 0.0000000 7.883333e-07 0.0000000 7.983333e-07 0.8800000 1.521667e-06 0.8800000 1.531667e-06 -0.8800000 2.255000e-06 -0.8800000 2.265000e-06 0.4400000 2.988333e-06 0.4400000
+ 2.998333e-06 -0.4400000 3.721667e-06 -0.4400000 3.731667e-06 0.0003000 4.455000e-06 0.0003000 4.465000e-06 0.8700000 5.188333e-06 0.8700000 5.198333e-06 -0.8700000 5.921667e-06 -0.8700000
+ 5.931667e-06 0.8800000 6.655000e-06 0.8800000 6.665000e-06 -0.8800000)
Vdb vdb 0 PWL(0 0.0000000 7.883333e-07 0.0000000 7.983333e-07 0.8800000 1.521667e-06 0.8800000 1.531667e-06 -0.8800000 2.255000e-06 -0.8800000 2.265000e-06 -0.4400000 2.988333e-06 -0.4400000
+ 2.998333e-06 0.4400000 3.721667e-06 0.4400000 3.731667e-06 -0.0003000 4.455000e-06 -0.0003000 4.465000e-06 -0.8700000 5.188333e-06 -0.8700000 5.198333e-06 0.8700000 5.921667e-06 0.8700000
+ 5.931667e-06 -0.8800000 6.655000e-06 -0.8800000 6.665000e-06 0.8800000)
Esp sinp vcm vda 0 0.5
Esn sinn vcm vda 0 -0.5
Ecp cosp vcm vdb 0 0.5
Ecn cosn vcm vdb 0 -0.5
Vip isap 0 0.6
Vin isan 0 0.6

XADC sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isap isan trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 clk30 wina winb lata latb
+ stba0 stba1 stba2 stba3 stba4 stba5 stba6 stba7 stba8 stba9 stba10 stba11 stba12 stba13
+ stbb0 stbb1 stbb2 stbb3 stbb4 stbb5 stbb6 stbb7 stbb8 stbb9 stbb10 stbb11 stbb12 stbb13
+ rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vrefa vrefb vrefla vreflb 0 vbg nbr vdda r1_adc5_core_lay

.control
